Subject: [PATCH] feat: support shuffled multi-file boot video playback

    - BootAnimation.h: change mVideoFile from char* to String8 and
      declare pickBootVideoFile()
    - BootAnimation.cpp: scan /product/media/bootanim for *.ts, persist
      shuffle order and position via persist.sys.bootvideo.order/pos,
      reshuffle after each full cycle, fall back to legacy single file

Change-Id: I90cc3cfdbc8e48bb34eac325177976fbb1082772
